{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tumne sahi dekha: 6 ka gol hissa neeche, 9 ka upar. Agar 6 ko ulta likhein, kya woh phir bhi chhah hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi, 6 ulta kare toh 9 ban jaata hai, chhah nahi."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, ulta 6 ab 9 ban jaata hai, chhah nahi. Ab zero ki baari. Do rotiyaan thi, dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero rotiyaan bachi. Zero ka matlab ek bhi nahi. Cricket mein batsman bina run banaye out ho, toh uska score kya hoga?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero. matlab... koi run nahi. haan zero."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, score zero hai, matlab ek bhi run nahi. Zero number kyun chahiye, jab kuch bhi na bache?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... jab kuch nahi bacha, toh... zero likhte hain?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, jab kuch nahi bachta, hum 0 likhte hain. Zero bhi number hai. Ab ulta gino: teen, do, ek. Uske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad zero aata hai ulta ginte hue. Ab chidiyaon ka socho: taar par teen baithi hain, teeno udd gayin. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, taar par zero chidiya bachi. Teeno udd gayin, isliye ek bhi nahi bachi. Aaj humne ginti ko numerals se milaya aur zero samjha. Kya aaj ke liye yahin rukein?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... game khelein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, khelte hain! Main pehle ek game dhoondhti hoon. Tab tak bolo, main jo number bolun, utni ungliyan dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"haan haan, dikhaungi"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ungliyan dikhana! Main bolun eight, tum aath ungliyan dikhao. Kitni ungliyan dikhaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":""},{"who":"teacher","text":"Aaram se, main yahin rukti hoon. Main bolun eight, tum kitni ungliyan dikhaoge?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.06053,"tokens":51151},"boards":5,"lastMs":2270,"noGame":true,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["3 chidiya","3 udd gayin","? bachi"],"words":"the